  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **DEATH GUARD** as your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), enemy units in Contagion Range of any **DEATH GUARD** model of yours are Afflicted.\n\n**Contagion Range** grows over the battle, but cannot exceed 12\" after modifiers:\n\n- battle round 1: 3\"\n- battle round 2: 6\"\n- battle round 3 onwards: 9\"\n\n**Afflicted**: during [Declare Battle Formations](vsdata:core-rule/chapter-approved.declare-battle-formations), pick a Plague from the list below. Models in Afflicted enemy units get -1 T, and those units carry the effect of the Plague you picked, for the rest of the battle. The Plagues are:\n\n- **Skullsquirm Blight**: ranged attacks by the unit's models give their targets the [benefit of cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover), and melee attacks by them get -1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls).\n- **Rattlejoint Ague**: the unit's models get -1 Sv.\n- **Scabrous Soulrot**: the unit's models get -1\" M, -1 Ld and -1 OC, but this cannot take their OC below 1.",
